Package: vabaxos-start
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1
Description: VabaxOS Start menu: search, and categories opened with the arrows
 Super opens it with the focus in the search field; results arrive while
 you write. With the field empty, Tab goes to the categories (Favorites,
 Programs divided as in Windows, VabaxOS tools, Settings, Folders, Recent
 files, Power): Right Arrow expands, Left Arrow goes back, letters jump.
 A tree the screen reader reads with its level and state.
